  "event_seq": 87,
  "root_problem": "On 2026-09-09 (CHG-77) a payments engineer disabled idempotency_key_enforcement on the gateway for latency debugging and never rolled it back (E-01); since gateway-timeout automatic capture retries continue at a stable ~120/day rate (E-02, E-04), those retries are now sent to the PSP with zero idempotency keys and the PSP no longer deduplicates them, so each retry creates a second real capture on the order (E-03), producing ~118-124 duplicate-charge orders/day (E-02) and a ~27x spike in double-charge support tickets (E-05)."
 },
